# dev-notes.17 — Worker Protocol Router Extraction

## Branch / work item

`runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1-worker-protocol-router`

## Purpose

Extract parent-side worker message routing from `inference.mjs` into `workerProtocolRouter.mjs` while preserving the current worker protocol contract and runtime lifecycle behavior.

This is behavior-preserving modularization only. It does not redesign worker messages, workerBridge ownership, scheduler behavior, request settlement semantics, stream shaping, init/reset/shutdown coordinators, config override surfaces, model identity/path behavior, or worker-local/native execution behavior.

## Files added

```text
workerProtocolRouter.mjs
docs/dev-notes.17
```

## Files modified

```text
inference.mjs
tests/smokeTestContextCreationCancelBoundary.mjs
tests/smokeTestContextCreationRetry.mjs
tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
tests/smokeTestNativeOperationHardStopPolicy.mjs
