tests/smokeTestWorkerOperationSerialization.mjs
```

## Implementation summary

`workerProtocolRouter.mjs` now exports:

```js
export function createWorkerProtocolRouter(ctx) { ... }
```

`inference.mjs` remains the composition root and wires the router through explicit dependency injection:

```js
onWorkerMessage(createWorkerProtocolRouter({
    config,
    lifecycle,
    scheduler,
    normalizeToken,
    pushStream,
    closeStream,
    errorStream,
    traceDone,
    traceError,
    traceDelete,
    settleCompletedRequest,
    settleFailedRequest
}));
```

The router module owns the moved `toErrorObject(raw)` helper and the worker message routing body that previously lived inline inside `inference.mjs`.

## Responsibilities moved

```text
ready message handling with init-attempt stale guard
session reset done/error waiter routing
model reset done/error waiter routing
shutdown done/error waiter routing
stream token routing and parent-side stream push
request done routing through scheduler.complete and settleCompletedRequest
init-error routing with init-attempt stale guard
legacy/no-attempt init failure routing
request error routing through scheduler.fail and settleFailedRequest
worker error object normalization helper
```

## Responsibilities intentionally kept in inference.mjs

```text
public API exports
composition root wiring
lifecycle state instance creation
scheduler creation
init coordinator context construction
prompt admission checks
cancelPrompt fast path
parent cancellation notification helpers
resetSession/resetModel/shutdownRuntime wrapper context wiring
workerBridge ownership through imported bridge helpers
```

## Behavior preservation checklist

The extraction preserves:

```text
ready stale-attempt guard
ready state mutation order
scheduler readiness set on ready
session reset waiter deletion and timedOut guard
model reset waiter clear-before-resolve behavior
shutdown waiter clear-before-resolve behavior
stream ignored for missing/canceled/done requests
stream normalization before finalText append
stream finalText append before pushStream
done path uses scheduler.complete before settlement
settleCompletedRequest dependency object and semantics
init error stale-attempt guard
model reset error precedence before generic init failure
shutdown error precedence before generic init failure
legacy/no-attempt init failure path
session reset error timedOut guard
request error uses scheduler.fail before settlement
settleFailedRequest dependency object and semantics
unknown messages remain ignored as before
```

## Fixture propagation

`workerProtocolRouter.mjs` was added to the fixture-copy `RUNTIME_FILES` lists in the current smoke tests that build temporary runtime trees from `inference.mjs` dependencies.

