## Caveats

This branch is intentionally narrow. It does not add new router tests beyond preserving and rerunning the existing lifecycle/router/settlement smoke suite. A future stale-message-specific router test could be considered if routing behavior is redesigned later, but it is not required for this behavior-preserving extraction.

## Recommended next work

After this branch is verified and checkpointed, the next work item should be reassessed against the current modularization state. Likely candidates are final cleanup/plumbing review or a separate future branch for one of the remaining open feature areas, not mixed into this router extraction.
